<gpx version="1.1" creator="galicica.finereli.com" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" xmlns:gpxx="http://www.garmin.com/xmlschemas/GpxExtensions/v3" xmlns:gpx_style="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/gpx_style/0/2">
<metadata><name>Velgoshti - Letnica - Ramne - Ohrid visitor centre</name><desc>A west-facing trail with the climbing spread fairly evenly. The lower part is in low vegetation, the upper part in forest. The ground is hard and stony, with lush grass in places. In several places, especially below Letnica and at the spot called Skala, you cross streams that are easy to cross for most of the year. https://galicica.finereli.com/routes/velgoshti-letnica-ramne-ohrid/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
<wpt lat="41.129361" lon="20.840295"><name>Start: Velgoshti village, St Petka monastery</name><desc>Velgoshti village, St Petka monastery to Ohrid visitor centre: 12.6 km, 5 h 15 min, moderate</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="41.104110" lon="20.819879"><name>Start: Ohrid visitor centre</name><desc>Ohrid visitor centre to Velgoshti village, St Petka monastery: 12.6 km, 5 h, moderate</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<trk><name>T-1: St Parascheva to the H-4 junction</name><desc>T-1 is one of Galičica National Park's harder and longer hiking trails, with more climbing. It's 6.1 km from St Parascheva to the H-4 junction, with about 682 m of climbing and 85 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 770 m and 1,457 m.</desc><type>T</type><extensions><gpxx:TrackExtension><gpxx:DisplayColor>DarkGreen</gpxx:DisplayColor></gpxx:TrackExtension><gpx_style:line><gpx_style:color>1F7A3D</gpx_style:color><gpx_style:width>4</gpx_style:width></gpx_style:line></extensions><trkseg><trkpt lat="41.129361" lon="20.840295"><ele>828</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.129361" lon="20.840292"><ele>828</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.129294" lon="20.839955"><ele>824</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.129239" lon="20.839740"><ele>819</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.129152" lon="20.839730"><ele>820</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.129140" lon="20.839676"><ele>818</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.129191" lon="20.839455"><ele>811</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.129257" lon="20.839469"><ele>811</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.129442" lon="20.839371"><ele>809</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.129380" lon="20.839173"><ele>803</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.129254" lon="20.838943"><ele>798</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.129056" lon="20.838433"><ele>791</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.128944" lon="20.837880"><ele>784</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.128868" lon="20.837642"><ele>779</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.128867" lon="20.837115"><ele>773</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.128845" lon="20.837033"><ele>773</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.128678" lon="20.837002"><ele>775</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.128459" lon="20.836923"><ele>776</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.128099" lon="20.836652"><ele>771</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.127837" lon="20.836519"><ele>770</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.127609" lon="20.836269"><ele>770</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.127462" lon="20.836260"><ele>771</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.127293" lon="20.836475"><ele>773</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.127045" lon="20.836985